<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Divine Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the divine sphere are prayers, granted by the powers the caster serves: healing and blessing for the good, curses and wounds for the evil, the holy and unholy words against the other side, aid and repulsion for the undead, and the finding of people and things. They draw on your divine power rather than your magic: how strongly one works depends on your divine power and your skill in that spell.
</p><p>The sphere itself is a category. It can't be practised: it rises by itself to half your best spell in it. It counts when you resist: against a divine spell aimed at you, you defend with your brain and the better of your divine sphere or half your skill in that spell (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level, and how far when a guild teaches less than 100%):
</p>
<pre>bless                  healer 9, paladin 35 (up to 50%)
unholy blessing        no guild teaches it
curse                  necromancer 18, dark knight 24
remove curse           healer 18, necromancer 24, paladin 24 (up to 50%)
cure light wounds      healer 0, paladin 10 (up to 50%)
cure serious wounds    healer 14, paladin 40 (up to 50%)
heal                   healer 30
dispel evil            healer 29, paladin 45 (up to 50%)
repel lesser undead    necromancer 2, dark knight 15, paladin 15 (up to 50%)
repel greater undead   necromancer 31
blind                  healer 8 (up to 50%), necromancer 9
cure blind             healer 15, druid 29 (up to 80%)
locate object          healer 19, druid 35
locate person          healer 20, druid 37
aid                    healer 2
summer rain            healer 4, druid 7
find path              healer 18, druid 34
dispel good            necromancer 39, dark knight 45
raise dead             healer 27
resurrection           healer 40
find wanted            assassin 0
locate wanted          assassin 0
slow rot               necromancer 34
aid undead             necromancer 60
final rest             healer 80, paladin 80
polarity               druid 120
cause light wounds     healer 1 (up to 80%), necromancer 1, dark knight 10
cause serious wounds   necromancer 13, healer 28 (up to 80%), dark knight 40
harm                   necromancer 29, healer 37 (up to 80%)
deathly grasp          necromancer 60, healer 120
holy word              healer 90, paladin 90
holy touch             paladin 100
holy grasp             paladin 120
holy shout             paladin 160
unholy word            necromancer 40
unholy touch           necromancer 80, dark knight 80
unholy grasp           necromancer 120, dark knight 120
unholy shout           necromancer 160, dark knight 160
condemn                dark knight 35
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
